rooms_desc ({"As you enter Tetsuhara's home you notice the spartan furnishings.  Styledwith a Japanese theme in mind, the shoji panels lend a serene luminescenceto the room.  The tatami feels warm below your feet and you feel compelledto remove your shoes and investigate the rest of the house.","You have entered the tea room.  This room is for formal occasions. A smalltable sits in the centre of the room, small pillows on each side of the table.","You have walked out of the house into the most beautiful and serenegarden setting you have ever seen.  The garden is designed alon thestrong lines of a warrior, but will all the grace and power of an artist.Simple Ponds intersperse the plants.  Toward on side you see a stone   garden setting, a seat beside it for contemplation of the mysteries ofthe universe.","You have entered the Dojo.  Tatami mats cover the polished floor in thecenter of the room.  Many weapons line the wall and training equipmentis placed strategically throughout the room.  On the wall are simplebanners showing Chi-kara symbols.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This room is quite different from the rest of the house.  Subdued lighthinglends a quiet ambience to the decor.  A large four pillared bed dominatesthe room.  A large box stands in the corner.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
